      <activity id="1e319116-22a0-5f85-a3aa-489722cf1004" activityNameId="98cd9bd9-4762-5744-b62c-d0180a7a4328" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Use, computer, desktop with CRT monitor, home use</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Use, computer, desktop with CRT monitor, home use
The computer desktop home use is calculated according to the share between active (3.14 hrs/day), standby (2.74 hrs/day) and off (18.24 hrs/day) modes taken from survey information. This dataset describes the application of a CRT monitor.;
Synonyms: PC; 
UUID: 4e0d48cf-541d-30dd-8f4e-744357a8d9f3
Describes the use of a desktop computer with a CRT monitor. Calculated per 1 hour of computer use at home. Swiss supply mix applied for electricity consumption (low voltage).
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: No technology involved, except for the production of the desktop computer, which is described in another dataset.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Producers, literature, survey and own assumptions 
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: Daily experiences confirm retrieved data from the survey.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_4e0d48cf-541d-30dd-8f4e-744357a8d9f3.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
